WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:13.970
called to her friends.

2
00:00:13.991 --> 00:00:16.972
"I have to go home," she said.

3
00:00:16.992 --> 00:00:21.975
"I have to um study for tomorrow's math quiz!"

4
00:00:24.076 --> 00:00:24.957
Roxy ran off.

5
00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:27.598
Terrell scratched his head.

6
00:00:27.618 --> 00:00:30.780
"We don't have a math quiz tomorrow."

7
00:00:35.252 --> 00:00:36.693
Roxy flew over Metro City.

8
00:00:39.575 --> 00:00:41.456
She saw a bus crash on West Street.

9
00:00:42.297 --> 00:00:45.599
People were running in every direction, waving their arms and screaming.

10
00:00:45.619 --> 00:00:50.483
"Those people must be running from the monster pets," thought Roxy.

11
00:00:51.363 --> 00:00:52.584
She flew down to the street.

12
00:00:53.785 --> 00:00:55.346
Monster pets were everywhere.

13
00:00:55.366 --> 00:01:00.370
"My poodle is attacking me!"

14
00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:01.370
cried an old man.

15
00:01:04.428 --> 00:01:04.708
"WOOF! WOOF!

16
00:01:04.768 --> 00:01:06.330
Grr!" The poodle snapped at the man's feet.

17
00:01:08.752 --> 00:01:10.753
A cat swatted at an old lady's cane.

18
00:01:10.773 --> 00:01:12.555
"Bad kitty!"

19
00:01:12.855 --> 00:01:13.536
cried the lady.

20
00:01:14.817 --> 00:01:17.819
A large man ran from a tiny dog that was breathing fire.

21
00:01:17.839 --> 00:01:20.001
"Run for your lives!"

22
00:01:20.242 --> 00:01:20.962
shouted the man.

23
00:01:20.982 --> 00:01:23.865
"Rocket Girl!"

24
00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:24.785
cried a voice.

25
00:01:26.046 --> 00:01:27.127
It was Detective Smith.

26
00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.770
He was hiding behind a crashed car.

27
00:01:31.331 --> 00:01:32.232
A woman was with him.

28
00:01:34.088 --> 00:01:37.410
Roxy saw a dog with spiky fur bite a tire off the car.

29
00:01:38.151 --> 00:01:39.452
The dog's collar was glowing.

30
00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:42.794
Roxy flew over to the car.

31
00:01:44.255 --> 00:01:45.216
The dog ran away.

32
00:01:48.798 --> 00:01:50.299
Detective," said Roxy.

33
00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:54.703
"I think you need to take your dog to dog training school!"

34
00:01:54.723 --> 00:01:58.945
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

35
00:01:58.966 --> 00:02:02.268
"That's not my dog, Rocket Girl."

36
00:02:03.624 --> 00:02:06.045
"He's my dog," said a woman.

37
00:02:06.065 --> 00:02:08.287
"His name is Ralphie."

38
00:02:08.307 --> 00:02:11.608
"Does Ralphie always act like that?"

39
00:02:12.029 --> 00:02:12.669
asked Roxy.

40
00:02:12.689 --> 00:02:15.851
"Of course not," said the woman.

41
00:02:16.411 --> 00:02:17.532
She smiled proudly.

42
00:02:17.552 --> 00:02:20.353
"He wins awards all the time.

43
00:02:21.233 --> 00:02:22.834
He was cute and furry this morning.

44
00:02:22.874 --> 00:02:25.936
But now The woman cried.

45
00:02:25.956 --> 00:02:28.277
"He looks like a monster!

46
00:02:28.297 --> 00:02:31.079
Oh! Poor Ralphie!"

47
00:02:31.099 --> 00:02:33.240
"How did this happen?"

48
00:02:33.532 --> 00:02:34.453
asked Detective Smith.

49
00:02:34.473 --> 00:02:37.255
"Did Ralphie eat anything strange today?"

50
00:02:37.275 --> 00:02:39.857
"No." The woman shook her head.

51
00:02:41.118 --> 00:02:42.279
Roxy glanced around.

52
00:02:44.361 --> 00:02:45.642
The monster pets were gone.

53
00:02:45.662 --> 00:02:49.225
"I wonder where they went," she thought.

54
00:02:50.446 --> 00:02:52.208
"What else did Ralphie do today?"

55
00:02:52.508 --> 00:02:53.429
asked Detective Smith.

56
00:02:54.349 --> 00:02:55.631
The woman thought for a moment.

57
00:02:56.972 --> 00:03:02.852
"After he ate, I took him to a wonderful new pet salon—Mr.

58
00:03:02.872 --> 00:03:05.113
Snippy's. Ralphie got a haircut and a manicure.

59
00:03:05.833 --> 00:03:07.493
Mr. Snippy is a lovely man.

60
00:03:08.654 --> 00:03:11.455
He gave Ralphie a new collar that glows."

61
00:03:13.075 --> 00:03:14.435
A man with a beard ran over.

62
00:03:15.496 --> 00:03:17.676
He wore sunglasses and a white tennis outfit.

63
00:03:17.696 --> 00:03:21.398
"Monster pets are invading Metro City Park!"

64
00:03:21.578 --> 00:03:22.298
the man shouted.

65
00:03:22.318 --> 00:03:24.418
"A dog ate the tennis net.

66
00:03:25.399 --> 00:03:26.939
Then a cat ate my racket!"

67
00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:29.480
"Uh-oh," thought Roxy.

68
00:03:30.156 --> 00:03:33.484
"Terrell, Mara, and Jack are at Metro City Park!"
